\sum_{n = 1}^\infty \frac{n^2 + n - 1}{(n + 2)!} &= \sum_{n = 1}^\infty \frac{n(n + 1) - 1}{(n + 2)!} \\
&= \sum_{n = 1}^\infty \left( \frac{n}{(n + 2)!} - \frac{1}{(n + 2)!} \right) \\
