solution_steps:
We perform long division:
$$\begin{array}{c|cc cc}
\multicolumn{2}{r}{x} & -4 \\
\cline{2-5}
x^2 + 5x + 1 & x^3 & & & \\
\multicolumn{2}{r}{-x^3} & -5x^2 & -x \\
\cline{2-4}
\multicolumn{2}{r}{0} & -5x^2 & -x \\
\multicolumn{2}{r}{} & +5x^2 & +25x & +5 \\
\cline{3-5}
\multicolumn{2}{r}{} & 0 & 24x & +5 \\
\end{array}$$
The remainder is $\boxed{24x + 5}$.The answer is: 24x+5

